Object.assign(khmerPhrases,{
 'Vichea needs a Supabase project to save classroom data and connect students in real time. Add your project details to get started.':'Vichea ត្រូវការគម្រោង Supabase ដើម្បីរក្សាទុកទិន្នន័យថ្នាក់ និងភ្ជាប់សិស្សក្នុងពេលជាក់ស្តែង។ បញ្ចូលព័ត៌មានគម្រោងដើម្បីចាប់ផ្តើម។','Supabase project URL':'URL គម្រោង Supabase','Supabase anon / publishable key':'កូនសោសាធារណៈ Supabase','Connect project':'ភ្ជាប់គម្រោង','Use the public anon key only. Never add a service role key here. Run':'ប្រើតែកូនសោសាធារណៈប៉ុណ្ណោះ។ កុំបញ្ចូលកូនសោសេវាកម្មនៅទីនេះ។ ដំណើរការ','in your Supabase SQL editor first.':'ក្នុងកម្មវិធីកែ SQL របស់ Supabase ជាមុនសិន។','Need a project?':'ត្រូវការគម្រោងមែនទេ?','Create one at Supabase':'បង្កើតគម្រោងនៅ Supabase','Create a teacher account':'បង្កើតគណនីគ្រូ','Students can join with a code and nickname.':'សិស្សអាចចូលរួមដោយប្រើកូដ និងឈ្មោះហៅក្រៅ។','Join as a student':'ចូលរួមជាសិស្ស','Enter a valid project URL and public key.':'បញ្ចូល URL គម្រោង និងកូនសោសាធារណៈដែលត្រឹមត្រូវ។','Enter a valid email and a password with at least 8 characters.':'បញ្ចូលអ៊ីមែលត្រឹមត្រូវ និងពាក្យសម្ងាត់យ៉ាងតិច ៨ តួអក្សរ។','Add your name to continue.':'បញ្ចូលឈ្មោះរបស់អ្នកដើម្បីបន្ត។','Account created. Welcome to Vichea!':'បានបង្កើតគណនីរួចរាល់។ សូមស្វាគមន៍មកកាន់ Vichea!','Check your email to confirm your account, then log in.':'ពិនិត្យអ៊ីមែលដើម្បីបញ្ជាក់គណនី បន្ទាប់មកចូលគណនី។','A quick read on what your classrooms need today.':'សេចក្តីសង្ខេបអំពីតម្រូវការរបស់ថ្នាក់រៀនអ្នកនៅថ្ងៃនេះ។','Connected to Vichea':'បានភ្ជាប់ទៅ Vichea','Create a session':'បង្កើតវគ្គ','Live classroom interaction':'អន្តរកម្មក្នុងថ្នាក់ផ្ទាល់','Sessions':'វគ្គ','Start a room for students to check in, ask, and respond together.':'ចាប់ផ្តើមបន្ទប់ឱ្យសិស្សឆ្លើយតប សួរសំណួរ និងចូលរួមជាមួយគ្នា។','+ Start a session':'ចាប់ផ្តើមវគ្គ','Restart session':'ចាប់ផ្តើមវគ្គឡើងវិញ','No sessions yet':'មិនទាន់មានវគ្គទេ','Create a session from one of your classrooms to get started.':'បង្កើតវគ្គពីថ្នាក់រៀនណាមួយរបស់អ្នកដើម្បីចាប់ផ្តើម។','Share the session code with your students.':'ចែករំលែកកូដវគ្គជាមួយសិស្ស។','All sessions':'វគ្គទាំងអស់','Students, join this session':'សិស្ស សូមចូលរួមវគ្គនេះ','Open the share link or enter the code below':'បើកតំណចែករំលែក ឬបញ្ចូលកូដខាងក្រោម','Copy join link':'ចម្លងតំណចូលរួម','Copy code':'ចម្លងកូដ','Understanding check-ins':'ការឆ្លើយតបអំពីការយល់ដឹង','Anonymous questions':'សំណួរអនាមិក','Many students are still confused. Consider pausing to explain this topic again.':'សិស្សជាច្រើននៅមិនទាន់យល់។ សូមពិចារណាផ្អាកដើម្បីពន្យល់ប្រធានបទនេះម្តងទៀត។','Several students need another example. A quick worked example may help.':'សិស្សមួយចំនួនត្រូវការឧទាហរណ៍បន្ថែម។ ឧទាហរណ៍ខ្លីមួយអាចជួយបាន។','Most responses show students understand so far.':'ចម្លើយភាគច្រើនបង្ហាញថាសិស្សយល់មេរៀន។','Check-in results will appear as students respond.':'លទ្ធផលនឹងបង្ហាញនៅពេលសិស្សឆ្លើយតប។','Student responses are private. Only class totals appear here.':'ចម្លើយរបស់សិស្សមានភាពឯកជន។ នៅទីនេះបង្ហាញតែលទ្ធផលសរុបរបស់ថ្នាក់។','Understand':'យល់','Need more examples':'ត្រូវការឧទាហរណ៍បន្ថែម','Need more support':'ត្រូវការជំនួយបន្ថែម','Session controls':'ការគ្រប់គ្រងវគ្គ','Pause session':'ផ្អាកវគ្គ','Resume session':'បន្តវគ្គ','End session':'បញ្ចប់វគ្គ','students have joined. New check-ins and questions appear here automatically.':'នាក់បានចូលរួម។ ការឆ្លើយតបថ្មី និងសំណួរនឹងបង្ហាញនៅទីនេះដោយស្វ័យប្រវត្តិ។','No polls yet.':'មិនទាន់មានការស្ទង់មតិទេ។','NEED A RESPONSE':'ត្រូវការចម្លើយ','PINNED':'បានខ្ទាស់','Respond':'ឆ្លើយតប','Unpin':'ដោះខ្ទាស់','Mark answered':'សម្គាល់ថាបានឆ្លើយ','Questions from students will show up here.':'សំណួរពីសិស្សនឹងបង្ហាញនៅទីនេះ។','Teacher response:':'ចម្លើយពីគ្រូ៖','Your classroom pulse':'ស្ថានភាពថ្នាក់រៀនរបស់អ្នក','Engagement insights':'ការយល់ដឹងអំពីការចូលរួម','Calculated from actual student responses in completed and active sessions.':'គណនាតាមចម្លើយពិតរបស់សិស្សក្នុងវគ្គសកម្ម និងវគ្គដែលបានបញ្ចប់។','Insights show up after students participate':'ការយល់ដឹងនឹងបង្ហាញក្រោយពេលសិស្សចូលរួម','Start a live session and use the understanding meter or polls. Results will be calculated from their responses.':'ចាប់ផ្តើមវគ្គបន្តផ្ទាល់ ហើយប្រើកម្រិតការយល់ដឹង ឬការស្ទង់មតិ។ លទ្ធផលនឹងគណនាតាមចម្លើយរបស់សិស្ស។','Your teaching notes':'កំណត់ចំណាំការបង្រៀនរបស់អ្នក','Review the understanding checks, polls, and questions from past sessions.':'ពិនិត្យការឆ្លើយតបអំពីការយល់ដឹង ការស្ទង់មតិ និងសំណួរពីវគ្គមុនៗ។','Open report':'បើករបាយការណ៍','End a live session to save its report.':'បញ្ចប់វគ្គបន្តផ្ទាល់ដើម្បីរក្សាទុករបាយការណ៍។','Session title':'ចំណងជើងវគ្គ','Lesson topic':'ប្រធានបទមេរៀន','Start a live session':'ចាប់ផ្តើមវគ្គបន្តផ្ទាល់','Create a classroom':'បង្កើតថ្នាក់រៀន','Set up a space for a subject or group.':'រៀបចំកន្លែងសម្រាប់មុខវិជ្ជា ឬក្រុមសិស្ស។','Classroom name':'ឈ្មោះថ្នាក់រៀន','Grade / level':'ថ្នាក់ / កម្រិត','Description (optional)':'ការពិពណ៌នា (ជាជម្រើស)','Attendance':'វត្តមាន','Classroom register':'បញ្ជីថ្នាក់រៀន','Create a classroom before adding students and recording attendance.':'សូមបង្កើតថ្នាក់រៀនមុនពេលបន្ថែមសិស្ស និងកត់ត្រាវត្តមាន។','Choose a classroom to view its student roster and attendance.':'ជ្រើសរើសថ្នាក់រៀនដើម្បីមើលបញ្ជីសិស្ស និងវត្តមាន។','Keep a class roster, record each date, and track attendance scores.':'រក្សាបញ្ជីសិស្ស កត់ត្រាតាមថ្ងៃ និងតាមដានពិន្ទុវត្តមាន។','Select a classroom':'ជ្រើសរើសថ្នាក់រៀន','Choose a classroom':'ជ្រើសរើសថ្នាក់រៀន','Attendance date':'កាលបរិច្ឆេទវត្តមាន','Add this day':'បន្ថែមថ្ងៃនេះ','Student roster':'បញ្ជីសិស្ស','Add student names. New attendance days start as Absent; click a status to update it.':'បន្ថែមឈ្មោះសិស្ស។ ថ្ងៃវត្តមានថ្មីចាប់ផ្តើមជាអវត្តមាន។ ចុចស្ថានភាពដើម្បីកែប្រែ។','Type a student name':'វាយឈ្មោះសិស្ស','Add student':'បន្ថែមសិស្ស','Loading attendance...':'កំពុងផ្ទុកទិន្នន័យវត្តមាន…','Attendance score':'ពិន្ទុវត្តមាន','Present = 1 · Late = 0.5 · Absent = 0':'មានវត្តមាន = ១ · យឺត = ០.៥ · អវត្តមាន = ០','Score is based on the dates recorded for each student. Days before a student is added to the roster aren’t counted.':'ពិន្ទុគិតតាមថ្ងៃដែលបានកត់ត្រាសម្រាប់សិស្សម្នាក់ៗ។ ថ្ងៃមុនពេលបន្ថែមសិស្សទៅក្នុងបញ្ជី មិនត្រូវបានរាប់ទេ។','Class average':'មធ្យមភាគថ្នាក់','Students with marks':'សិស្សដែលមានកំណត់ត្រា','No students yet':'មិនទាន់មានសិស្សទេ','No attendance sheet for this date yet. Click':'មិនទាន់មានតារាងវត្តមានសម្រាប់ថ្ងៃនេះទេ។ ចុច','to create one.':'ដើម្បីបង្កើត។','No questions yet':'មិនទាន់មានសំណួរទេ','No reports yet':'មិនទាន់មានរបាយការណ៍ទេ','Student voice':'សំឡេងសិស្ស','Questions from your live sessions. Students remain anonymous to their classmates.':'សំណួរពីវគ្គបន្តផ្ទាល់របស់អ្នក។ សិស្សនៅតែអនាមិកចំពោះមិត្តរួមថ្នាក់។','Open a live session to review questions':'បើកវគ្គបន្តផ្ទាល់ដើម្បីពិនិត្យសំណួរ','Select a session to see submissions and respond.':'ជ្រើសរើសវគ្គដើម្បីមើលសំណួរ និងឆ្លើយតប។','Go to sessions':'ទៅកាន់វគ្គ','No questions submitted yet':'មិនទាន់មានសំណួរទេ','Join your class.':'ចូលរួមថ្នាក់រៀន','Enter the code your teacher shared. No account needed.':'បញ្ចូលកូដដែលគ្រូបានចែករំលែក។ មិនចាំបាច់មានគណនីទេ។','Your nickname':'ឈ្មោះហៅក្រៅ','Join session':'ចូលរួមវគ្គ','Your nickname is only visible to your teacher.':'មានតែគ្រូប៉ុណ្ណោះដែលអាចឃើញឈ្មោះហៅក្រៅរបស់អ្នក។','How are you feeling about this lesson?':'តើអ្នកមានអារម្មណ៍យ៉ាងណាចំពោះមេរៀននេះ?','Your answer is private. Only your teacher sees the class totals.':'ចម្លើយរបស់អ្នកមានភាពឯកជន។ មានតែគ្រូប៉ុណ្ណោះដែលឃើញលទ្ធផលសរុប។','Ask a question, anonymously':'សួរសំណួរដោយអនាមិក','Your teacher can see who joined, but your classmates won’t see your name with this question.':'គ្រូអាចឃើញថាអ្នកណាបានចូលរួម ប៉ុន្តែមិត្តរួមថ្នាក់មិនឃើញឈ្មោះអ្នកជាមួយសំណួរនេះទេ។','What would you like your teacher to explain?':'តើអ្នកចង់ឱ្យគ្រូពន្យល់អ្វី?','Send anonymously':'ផ្ញើដោយអនាមិក','Teacher responses':'ចម្លើយពីគ្រូ','This session has ended. Thanks for participating.':'វគ្គនេះបានបញ្ចប់ហើយ។ អរគុណដែលបានចូលរួម។','Your teacher has paused this session. Hang tight!':'គ្រូបានផ្អាកវគ្គនេះ។ សូមរង់ចាំបន្តិច។','Quiz complete':'បានបញ្ចប់សំណួរ','Your teacher will reveal the class leaderboard when the quiz ends.':'គ្រូនឹងបង្ហាញតារាងចំណាត់ថ្នាក់ពេលសំណួរបញ្ចប់។','Quiz results and leaderboard':'លទ្ធផលសំណួរ និងតារាងចំណាត់ថ្នាក់','Class leaderboard':'តារាងចំណាត់ថ្នាក់ថ្នាក់រៀន','Correct':'ត្រឹមត្រូវ','Score':'ពិន្ទុ','No quiz participants to rank yet.':'មិនទាន់មានអ្នកចូលរួមសម្រាប់ចំណាត់ថ្នាក់ទេ។','No quiz folders yet. Create one, add questions, then launch it for your students.':'មិនទាន់មានថតសំណួរទេ។ បង្កើតថត បន្ថែមសំណួរ រួចចាប់ផ្តើមសម្រាប់សិស្ស។','Group questions into a set, then launch them in order.':'ដាក់សំណួរជាក្រុម រួចចាប់ផ្តើមឱ្យសិស្សឆ្លើយតាមលំដាប់។','Timer set per question':'កំណត់ម៉ោងតាមសំណួរ','This question:':'សំណួរនេះ៖','Time left:':'ពេលវេលានៅសល់៖','Close voting':'បិទការបោះឆ្នោត','responses':'ចម្លើយ','No polls yet.':'មិនទាន់មានការស្ទង់មតិទេ។','Create a quick poll':'បង្កើតការស្ទង់មតិរហ័ស','Answer options (one per line)':'ជម្រើសចម្លើយ (មួយក្នុងមួយបន្ទាត់)','Show results to students after voting':'បង្ហាញលទ្ធផលដល់សិស្សក្រោយពេលបោះឆ្នោត','Launch poll':'ចាប់ផ្តើមការស្ទង់មតិ','Correct answer':'ចម្លើយត្រឹមត្រូវ','No timer':'គ្មានម៉ោងកំណត់','Choice 1':'ជម្រើសទី ១','Choice 2':'ជម្រើសទី ២','Choice 3':'ជម្រើសទី ៣','Choice 4':'ជម្រើសទី ៤','Choice 5':'ជម្រើសទី ៥','Choice 6':'ជម្រើសទី ៦','5 seconds':'៥ វិនាទី','10 seconds':'១០ វិនាទី','15 seconds':'១៥ វិនាទី','20 seconds':'២០ វិនាទី','30 seconds':'៣០ វិនាទី','45 seconds':'៤៥ វិនាទី','60 seconds':'៦០ វិនាទី','90 seconds':'៩០ វិនាទី','120 seconds':'១២០ វិនាទី','180 seconds':'១៨០ វិនាទី','1 minute':'១ នាទី','2 minutes':'២ នាទី','3 minutes':'៣ នាទី','Delete':'លុប','Cancel':'បោះបង់','Close':'បិទ','Save':'រក្សាទុក','Open report':'បើករបាយការណ៍','Delete classroom':'លុបថ្នាក់រៀន','Delete session':'លុបវគ្គ','End session':'បញ្ចប់វគ្គ','Delete poll':'លុបការស្ទង់មតិ','All sessions':'វគ្គទាំងអស់','Student voice':'សំឡេងសិស្ស','Session reports':'របាយការណ៍វគ្គ','Loading...':'កំពុងផ្ទុក…'
});
delete khmerPhrases['class'];delete khmerPhrases['response'];delete khmerPhrases['correct'];delete khmerPhrases['present'];delete khmerPhrases['late'];delete khmerPhrases['absent'];
const textOrigins=new WeakMap(),attributeOrigins=new WeakMap();
function greetingName(){const h=new Date().getHours(),salutation=h<12?'Good morning':h<17?'Good afternoon':'Good evening';return salutation+', '+(state.profile?.full_name||'teacher').split(' ')[0]}
function translateText(text){let out=text.replace(/(\d+)\s+questions?/gi,'$1 សំណួរ').replace(/(\d+) sec\b/g,'$1 វិនាទី');for(const [en,km] of Object.entries(khmerPhrases).sort((a,b)=>b[0].length-a[0].length))out=out.replaceAll(en,km);return out}
function ensureLanguageToggle(root){if(!root)return;const host=root.querySelector('.topbar-right,.student-top,.auth-card,.join-card');if(!host||host.querySelector('#language-switch'))return;const button=document.createElement('button');button.id='language-switch';button.className='btn btn-outline btn-sm language-switch';button.type='button';button.innerHTML='<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3a15 15 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a15 15 0 0 0 0 18"/></svg><span></span>';button.onclick=toggleLanguage;host.append(button)}
function applyLanguage(root=app){if(!root)return;document.documentElement.lang=uiLanguage==='km'?'km':'en';ensureLanguageToggle(root);const walker=document.createTreeWalker(root,NodeFilter.SHOW_TEXT);let node;while(node=walker.nextNode()){if(node.parentElement?.closest('#language-switch,[data-no-translate],script,style'))continue;if(!textOrigins.has(node))textOrigins.set(node,node.nodeValue);node.nodeValue=uiLanguage==='km'?translateText(textOrigins.get(node)):textOrigins.get(node)}root.querySelectorAll('[placeholder],[title],[aria-label]').forEach(el=>{let originals=attributeOrigins.get(el);if(!originals){originals={};for(const key of ['placeholder','title','aria-label'])if(el.hasAttribute(key))originals[key]=el.getAttribute(key);attributeOrigins.set(el,originals)}for(const [key,value] of Object.entries(originals))el.setAttribute(key,uiLanguage==='km'?translateText(value):value)});const button=root.querySelector('#language-switch');if(button){button.querySelector('span').textContent=uiLanguage==='km'?'English':'ខ្មែរ';button.setAttribute('aria-label',uiLanguage==='km'?'Switch to English':'ប្តូរទៅភាសាខ្មែរ')}const locale=uiLanguage==='km'?'km-KH':'en-US',today=new Date();const dateChip=root.querySelector('.date-chip');if(dateChip)dateChip.textContent=today.toLocaleDateString(locale,{weekday:'short',month:'short',day:'numeric'});const longDate=root.querySelector('[data-current-date="long"]');if(longDate)longDate.textContent=today.toLocaleDateString(locale,{weekday:'long',month:'long',day:'numeric'})}
window.toggleLanguage=()=>{uiLanguage=uiLanguage==='en'?'km':'en';localStorage.setItem('vichea_language',uiLanguage);applyLanguage(app)};

const esc=s=>String(s??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
const initials=s=>(s||'Teacher').trim().split(/\s+/).map(x=>x[0]).join('').slice(0,2).toUpperCase();
const dateFmt=d=>new Date(d).toLocaleDateString(uiLanguage==='km'?'km-KH':'en-US',{month:'short',day:'numeric',year:'numeric'});
const toast=(message,good=false)=>{const root=document.getElementById('toast-root');root.innerHTML=`<div class="toast" style="${good?'background:#187e62':''}">${esc(uiLanguage==='km'?translateText(message):message)}</div>`;setTimeout(()=>root.innerHTML='',3200)};
const dbError=e=>{console.error(e);toast(e?.message||'Something went wrong. Please try again.')};
function configScreen(){app.innerHTML=`<div class="auth-wrap"><div class="auth-card"><div class="brand" style="padding:0"><span class="brand-mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 7v14m0-14C10.5 5.7 8.5 5 6 5S2 5.7 2 7v12c0-1.3 1.5-2 4-2s4 .7 6 2m0-12c1.5-1.3 3.5-2 6-2s4 .7 4 2v12c0-1.3-1.5-2-4-2s-4 .7-6 2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="brand-name">Vichea</span></div><h1>Your classroom, in sync.</h1><p>Vichea needs a Supabase project to save classroom data and connect students in real time. Add your project details to get started.</p><div class="field"><label>Supabase project URL</label><input id="cfg-url" placeholder="https://your-project.supabase.co"></div><div class="field"><label>Supabase anon / publishable key</label><input id="cfg-key" placeholder="sb_publishable_..." autocomplete="off"></div><button class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%;margin:4px 0 12px" onclick="saveConfig()">Connect project</button><p style="font-size:10px;margin:0">Use the public anon key only. Never add a service role key here. Run <code>supabase/schema.sql</code> in your Supabase SQL editor first.</p><div style="border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin:20px 0 0;padding-top:16px;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Need a project? <a href="https://supabase.com/dashboard" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" style="color:var(--blue)">Create one at Supabase</a> &middot; <button class="linklike" onclick="enterStudent()">Join as a student</button></div></div></div>`;applyLanguage(app)}
window.saveConfig=()=>{const u=document.getElementById('cfg-url').value.trim(),k=document.getElementById('cfg-key').value.trim();if(!u.startsWith('https://')||k.length<12)return toast('Enter a valid project URL and public key.');localStorage.setItem('cp_url',u);localStorage.setItem('cp_key',k);location.reload()};
async function start(){if(!client){configScreen();return}const {data:{session},error}=await client.auth.getSession();if(error)return configScreen();state.user=session?.user||null;if(!state.user){authScreen();return}const {data,error:e}=await client.from('profiles').select('*').eq('id',state.user.id).maybeSingle();if(e){dbError(e);authScreen();return}state.profile=data;renderShell();await loadData()}
function authScreen(){app.innerHTML=`<div class="auth-wrap"><div class="auth-card"><div class="brand" style="padding:0"><span class="brand-mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 7v14m0-14C10.5 5.7 8.5 5 6 5S2 5.7 2 7v12c0-1.3 1.5-2 4-2s4 .7 6 2m0-12c1.5-1.3 3.5-2 6-2s4 .7 4 2v12c0-1.3-1.5-2-4-2s-4 .7-6 2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="brand-name">Vichea</span></div><div class="role-switch"><button class="active" id="login-tab" onclick="setAuthMode('login')">Log in</button><button id="signup-tab" onclick="setAuthMode('signup')">Create teacher account</button></div><h1 id="auth-title">Welcome back.</h1><p id="auth-desc">Sign in to check in with your classrooms.</p><div class="field" id="name-field" style="display:none"><label>Your name</label><input id="auth-name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="e.g. Jordan Lee"></div><div class="field"><label>Email address</label><input id="auth-email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@school.edu"></div><div class="field"><label>Password</label><input id="auth-pass" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="At least 8 characters"></div><button class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%" id="auth-submit" onclick="submitAuth()">Log in</button><p style="font-size:10px;margin:18px 0 0;text-align:center">Students can join with a code and nickname. <button class="linklike" onclick="enterStudent()">Join a session</button></p></div></div>`;applyLanguage(app)}
let authMode='login';window.setAuthMode=m=>{authMode=m;document.getElementById('login-tab').classList.toggle('active',m==='login');document.getElementById('signup-tab').classList.toggle('active',m==='signup');document.getElementById('name-field').style.display=m==='signup'?'flex':'none';document.getElementById('auth-title').textContent=m==='signup'?'Make room for every voice.':'Welcome back.';document.getElementById('auth-desc').textContent=m==='signup'?'Create your teacher account to set up a classroom.':'Sign in to check in with your classrooms.';document.getElementById('auth-submit').textContent=m==='signup'?'Create account':'Log in';applyLanguage(app)};
window.submitAuth=async()=>{const email=document.getElementById('auth-email').value.trim(),password=document.getElementById('auth-pass').value,name=document.getElementById('auth-name')?.value.trim();if(!email||password.length<8)return toast('Enter a valid email and a password with at least 8 characters.');let result;if(authMode==='signup'){if(!name)return toast('Add your name to continue.');result=await client.auth.signUp({email,password,options:{data:{full_name:name},emailRedirectTo:window.location.origin}});if(!result.error&&result.data.user){if(result.data.session){await client.from('profiles').upsert({id:result.data.user.id,full_name:name,role:'teacher'});toast('Account created. Welcome to Vichea!',true);start()}else toast('Check your email to confirm your account, then log in.',true);return}}else result=await client.auth.signInWithPassword({email,password});if(result.error)return dbError(result.error);start()};
window.enterStudent=()=>{if(state.channel){state.channel.unsubscribe();state.channel=null}studentJoinScreen()};
function iconSvg(name){const paths={home:'<path d="m3 10 9-7 9 7v10a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6v-7h-4v7H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1z"/>',classes:'<rect x="3" y="3" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5"/><rect x="13" y="3" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5"/><rect x="3" y="13" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5"/><rect x="13" y="13" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5"/>',attendance:'<rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="15" rx="2"/><path d="M8 3v4m8-4v4M4 9h16m-11 4 2 2 4-4"/>',sessions:'<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="m10 8 6 4-6 4z"/>',questions:'<path d="M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.4 8.4 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-.9-3.8A8.5 8.5 0 0 1 8.7 4a8.4 8.4 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.5 8.5 0 0 1 8 8z"/>',pulse:'<path d="M12 7v14m0-14C10.5 5.7 8.5 5 6 5S2 5.7 2 7v12c0-1.3 1.5-2 4-2s4 .7 6 2m0-12c1.5-1.3 3.5-2 6-2s4 .7 4 2v12c0-1.3-1.5-2-4-2s-4 .7-6 2"/>',reports:'<path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8m-8 4h8"/>'};return `<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">${paths[name]||paths.home}</g></svg>`}
function navButton(id,label,icon){return `<button class="nav-btn ${state.view===id?'active':''}" onclick="navigate('${id}')"><span class="nav-icon">${iconSvg(icon)}</span><span class="nav-text">${label}</span></button>`}function renderShell(){const who=state.profile?.full_name||state.user?.email||'Teacher';app.innerHTML=`<div class="app-shell"><aside class="sidebar"><div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 7v14m0-14C10.5 5.7 8.5 5 6 5S2 5.7 2 7v12c0-1.3 1.5-2 4-2s4 .7 6 2m0-12c1.5-1.3 3.5-2 6-2s4 .7 4 2v12c0-1.3-1.5-2-4-2s-4 .7-6 2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="brand-name">Vichea</span></div><div class="nav-label">Workspace</div>${navButton('overview','Overview','home')}${navButton('classrooms','My classrooms','classes')}${navButton('attendance','Attendance','attendance')}${navButton('sessions','Live sessions','sessions')}${navButton('questions','Anonymous questions','questions')}<div class="nav-label" style="margin-top:17px">Insights</div>${navButton('analytics','Classroom pulse','pulse')}${navButton('reports','Session reports','reports')}<div class="side-bottom"><button class="nav-btn" onclick="openSettings()"><span class="nav-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M19.4 15a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 .3 1.9l.1.1-1.7 2.9-.2-.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.8.1 1.7 1.7 0 0 0-.8 1.5v.2h-3.4v-.2a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.1-1.5 1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.8.2l-.2.1-1.7-2.9.1-.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 .3-1.9 1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.5-.9h-.2v-3.4h.2a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.5-1 1.7 1.7 0 0 0-.3-1.8l-.1-.2 1.7-2.9.2.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.8-.1 1.7 1.7 0 0 0 .8-1.5V3h3.4v.2a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.1 1.5 1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.8-.2l.2-.1 1.7 2.9-.1.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-.3 1.9 1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.5.9h.2v3.4h-.2a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.5 1z"/></g></svg></span>Settings</button><div class="profile-mini"><div class="avatar">${esc(initials(who))}</div><div style="flex:1"><strong>${esc(who)}</strong><small>Teacher account</small></div><button class="close" title="Sign out" onclick="signOut()">&#8599;</button></div></div></aside><main class="main"><header class="topbar"><span class="crumb">Workspace <span style="color:#c8cad4">/</span> <strong id="crumb-page">Overview</strong></span><div class="topbar-right"><span class="date-chip">${new Date().toLocaleDateString(uiLanguage==='km'?'km-KH':'en-US',{weekday:'short',month:'short',day:'numeric'})}</span><span class="status-chip"><span class="live-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Connected to Vichea</span></div></header><div id="page-content" class="page"></div></main><nav class="mobile-nav">${navButton('overview','Home','home')}${navButton('classrooms','Classes','classes')}${navButton('attendance','Attendance','attendance')}${navButton('sessions','Sessions','sessions')}${navButton('analytics','Pulse','pulse')}${navButton('questions','Questions','questions')}</nav><div id="modal-root"></div></div>`;renderPage()}
window.navigate=async v=>{state.view=v;document.querySelectorAll('.nav-btn').forEach(n=>n.classList.toggle('active',n.getAttribute('onclick')===`navigate('${v}')`));document.getElementById('crumb-page').textContent=({overview:'Overview',classrooms:'My classrooms',sessions:'Live sessions',questions:'Anonymous questions',analytics:'Classroom pulse',reports:'Session reports',attendance:'Attendance'})[v]||v;await loadData();renderPage()};
window.signOut=async()=>{await client.auth.signOut();state.user=null;state.profile=null;authScreen()};
async function loadData(){if(!state.user)return;const [c,s]=await Promise.all([client.from('classrooms').select('*,classroom_members(count)').eq('teacher_id',state.user.id).order('created_at',{ascending:false}),client.from('sessions').select('*,classrooms(name)').eq('teacher_id',state.user.id).order('created_at',{ascending:false})]);if(c.error)return dbError(c.error);if(s.error)return dbError(s.error);state.classrooms=c.data||[];state.sessions=s.data||[];if(state.selected)await loadSessionData(state.selected.id)}
async function loadSessionData(id){const [m,q,p,part]=await Promise.all([client.from('understanding_responses').select('response').eq('session_id',id),client.from('questions').select('*').eq('session_id',id).order('created_at',{ascending:false}),client.from('polls').select('*,poll_options(*),poll_responses(participant_id,option_id)').eq('session_id',id).order('created_at',{ascending:false}),client.from('session_participants').select('id,nickname,joined_at').eq('session_id',id)]);for(const x of [m,q,p,part])if(x.error){dbError(x.error);return}state.meter={green:m.data.filter(x=>x.response==='green').length,yellow:m.data.filter(x=>x.response==='yellow').length,red:m.data.filter(x=>x.response==='red').length};state.questions=q.data;state.polls=p.data;state.participants=part.data;const sets=await client.from('quiz_sets').select('*').eq('session_id',id).order('created_at',{ascending:false});if(sets.error){state.quizSets=[];state.quizTablesReady=false;if(!['42P01','PGRST202','PGRST205'].includes(sets.error.code))dbError(sets.error);return}state.quizTablesReady=true;state.quizSets=sets.data||[];const quizPollIds=state.polls.filter(p=>p.quiz_set_id).map(p=>p.id);if(!quizPollIds.length){state.quizAttempts=[];return}const attempts=await client.from('quiz_question_attempts').select('participant_id,poll_id,is_correct,answered_at,timed_out').in('poll_id',quizPollIds);if(attempts.error){state.quizAttempts=[];if(!['42P01','PGRST205'].includes(attempts.error.code))dbError(attempts.error);return}state.quizAttempts=attempts.data||[]}
const activeSessions=()=>state.sessions.filter(s=>s.status==='live'||s.status==='paused');
function renderPage(){const root=document.getElementById('page-content');if(!root)return;if(state.view==='session'&&state.selected){renderLiveSession(root);applyLanguage(app);return}const pages={overview:renderOverview,classrooms:renderClassrooms,sessions:renderSessions,questions:renderQuestions,analytics:renderAnalytics,reports:renderReports,attendance:renderAttendance};(pages[state.view]||renderOverview)(root);applyLanguage(app)}
function renderOverview(root){const live=activeSessions(),members=state.classrooms.reduce((n,c)=>n+(c.classroom_members?.[0]?.count||0),0);root.innerHTML=`<div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow" data-current-date="long">${new Date().toLocaleDateString(uiLanguage==='km'?'km-KH':'en-US',{weekday:'long',month:'long',day:'numeric'})}</p><h1>${esc(greetingName())}</h1><p class="subtext">A quick read on what your classrooms need today.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="openSessionModal()">+ Create a session</button></div><div class="card"><div class="section-head"><h2>Get started</h2><span class="tag">YOUR WORKSPACE</span></div><div class="activity"><span class="activity-dot">1</span><div><p><strong>Create a classroom</strong><br>Set up a space for a subject or group.</p><small>CLASSROOMS &middot; 2 MIN</small></div></div><div class="activity"><span class="activity-dot">2</span><div><p><strong>Start a session</strong><br>Share a code so students can join from any device.</p><small>LIVE SESSIONS</small></div></div><div class="activity"><span class="activity-dot">3</span><div><p><strong>Hear from every student</strong><br>Use check-ins and anonymous questions.</p><small>UNDERSTANDING METER</small></div></div></div></section>`}
function sessionCard(s){return `<div class="session-card" onclick="openSession('${s.id}')"><div class="session-color"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="m10 8 6 4-6 4z"/></g></svg></div><div class="session-info"><strong>${esc(s.title)}</strong><small>${esc(s.subject||s.classrooms?.name||'Classroom')} &middot; ${dateFmt(s.created_at)}</small></div><span class="live-pill">${s.status==='live'?'LIVE':'PAUSED'}</span></div>`}
function localDateString(){const d=new Date();return new Date(d.getTime()-d.getTimezoneOffset()*60000).toISOString().slice(0,10)}
window.openAttendance=id=>{state.attendanceClassroomId=id;state.view='attendance';navigate('attendance')};
window.setAttendanceClass=id=>{state.attendanceClassroomId=id;renderPage()};
window.setAttendanceDate=date=>{state.attendanceDate=date;renderPage()};
window.shiftAttendanceDate=amount=>{if(!state.attendanceDate)state.attendanceDate=localDateString();const [year,month,day]=state.attendanceDate.split('-').map(Number);const date=new Date(year,month-1,day);date.setDate(date.getDate()+amount);state.attendanceDate=[date.getFullYear(),String(date.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0'),String(date.getDate()).padStart(2,'0')].join('-');renderPage()};
function renderAttendance(root){if(!state.classrooms.length){root.innerHTML=`<div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Classroom register</p><h1>Attendance</h1><p class="subtext">Create a classroom before adding students and recording attendance.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="openClassModal()">Create classroom</button></div>`;return}if(!state.attendanceClassroomId||!state.classrooms.some(c=>c.id===state.attendanceClassroomId)){state.attendanceClassroomId='';root.innerHTML=`<div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Classroom register</p><h1>Attendance</h1><p class="subtext">Choose a classroom to view its student roster and attendance.</p></div></div><div class="card" style="max-width:520px"><div class="field"><label>Select a classroom</label><select onchange="setAttendanceClass(this.value)"><option value="">Choose a classroom</option>${state.classrooms.map(c=>`<option value="${c.id}">${esc(c.name)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div></div>`;return}if(!state.attendanceDate)state.attendanceDate=localDateString();root.innerHTML=`<div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Classroom register</p><h1>Attendance</h1><p class="subtext">Keep a class roster, record each date, and track attendance scores.</p></div></div><div class="card attendance-toolbar"><div class="field"><label>Classroom</label><select onchange="setAttendanceClass(this.value)">${state.classrooms.map(c=>`<option value="${c.id}" ${c.id===state.attendanceClassroomId?'selected':''}>${esc(c.name)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>Attendance date</label><div class="date-stepper"><button class="btn btn-outline" title="Previous day" aria-label="Previous day" onclick="shiftAttendanceDate(-1)">&larr;</button><input type="date" value="${esc(state.attendanceDate)}" onchange="setAttendanceDate(this.value)"><button class="btn btn-outline" title="Next day" aria-label="Next day" onclick="shiftAttendanceDate(1)">&rarr;</button></div></div><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="addAttendanceDay()">&plus; Add this day</button></div><div class="card" style="margin-top:16px"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Student roster</h2><p class="subtext" style="margin-top:5px">Add student names. New attendance days start as Absent; click a status to update it.</p></div><span class="tag" id="roster-count">Loading...</span></div><div class="add-student-row"><input id="new-student-name" placeholder="Type a student name"><button class="btn btn-outline" onclick="addRosterStudent()">Add student</button></div><div id="attendance-register"><div class="empty">Loading attendance?</div></div></div><div class="card" style="margin-top:16px"><div class="section-head"><h2>Attendance score</h2><span class="subtext">Present = 1 &middot; Late = 0.5 &middot; Absent = 0</span></div><p class="subtext">Score is based on the dates recorded for each student. Days before a student is added to the roster aren't counted.</p><div id="attendance-scores"><div class="empty">Loading scores?</div></div></div>`;loadAttendanceData()}
async function loadAttendanceData(){const classroomId=state.attendanceClassroomId;if(!classroomId)return;const [rosterResult,daysResult]=await Promise.all([client.from('classroom_members').select('id,nickname,student_name,joined_at').eq('classroom_id',classroomId).order('student_name'),client.from('classroom_attendance_days').select('id,attendance_date').eq('classroom_id',classroomId).order('attendance_date',{ascending:false})]);if(rosterResult.error)return dbError(rosterResult.error);if(daysResult.error)return dbError(daysResult.error);const roster=rosterResult.data||[],days=daysResult.data||[];const recordsResult=days.length?await client.from('classroom_attendance_records').select('*').in('attendance_day_id',days.map(d=>d.id)):{data:[],error:null};if(recordsResult.error)return dbError(recordsResult.error);const records=recordsResult.data||[];const selectedDay=days.find(d=>d.attendance_date===state.attendanceDate);const count=status=>selectedDay?records.filter(r=>r.attendance_day_id===selectedDay.id&&r.status===status).length:0;const register=document.getElementById('attendance-register');if(!register)return;document.getElementById('roster-count').textContent=`${roster.length} STUDENT${roster.length===1?'':'S'}`;register.innerHTML=`${selectedDay?`<div class="attendance-day-summary"><span>${new Date(state.attendanceDate+'T12:00:00').toLocaleDateString(undefined,{weekday:'long',month:'long',day:'numeric',year:'numeric'})}</span><span class="tag">${count('present')} PRESENT &bull; ${count('late')} LATE &bull; ${count('absent')} ABSENT</span></div>`:`<div class="empty">No attendance sheet for this date yet. Click <strong>Add this day</strong> to create one.</div>`}${roster.length?roster.map(m=>{const rec=selectedDay?records.find(r=>r.attendance_day_id===selectedDay.id&&r.classroom_member_id===m.id):null,status=rec?.status;return `<div class="attendance-row"><div><strong>${esc(m.student_name||m.nickname)}</strong><small>${status?`Marked ${status}`:'Not marked'}</small></div><div class="attendance-actions">${selectedDay?[['present','Present'],['late','Late'],['absent','Absent']].map(([v,l])=>`<button class="btn btn-sm ${status===v?`attendance-selected attendance-${v}`:'btn-outline'}" onclick="markClassAttendance('${m.id}','${v}')">${l}</button>`).join(''):''}<button class="btn btn-danger btn-sm" onclick="removeRosterStudent('${m.id}','${esc(m.student_name||m.nickname)}')">Remove</button></div></div>`}).join(''):'<div class="empty">Add students to this classroom roster to take attendance.</div>'}`;const scores=document.getElementById('attendance-scores');if(!scores)return;const scoreData=roster.map(m=>{const mine=records.filter(r=>r.classroom_member_id===m.id);const present=mine.filter(r=>r.status==='present').length,late=mine.filter(r=>r.status==='late').length,absent=mine.filter(r=>r.status==='absent').length,daysCount=mine.length,points=present+late*.5;return {member:m,present,late,absent,daysCount,score:daysCount?Math.round(points/daysCount*100):null}});const scored=scoreData.filter(x=>x.score!==null),average=scored.length?Math.round(scored.reduce((n,x)=>n+x.score,0)/scored.length):null;scores.innerHTML=roster.length?`<div class="score-summary"><div><span>Class average</span><strong>${average===null?'&mdash;':average+'%'}</strong></div><div><span>Students with marks</span><strong>${scored.length} / ${roster.length}</strong></div><div class="score-key"><i class="key-present"></i>Present = 1 <i class="key-late"></i>Late = 0.5 <i class="key-absent"></i>Absent = 0</div></div><div class="score-list">${scoreData.map(x=>{const name=x.member.student_name||x.member.nickname,barColor=x.score===null?'#e9ebf2':x.score>=80?'var(--green)':x.score>=50?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)';return `<div class="score-row"><div class="score-student"><div class="avatar">${esc(initials(name))}</div><div><strong>${esc(name)}</strong><small>${x.daysCount} recorded day${x.daysCount===1?'':'s'}</small></div></div><div class="score-breakdown"><span><i class="key-present"></i>${x.present} present</span><span><i class="key-late"></i>${x.late} late</span><span><i class="key-absent"></i>${x.absent} absent</span></div><div class="score-meter"><span class="bar"><i style="width:${x.score||0}%;background:${barColor}"></i></span><strong style="color:${x.score===null?'var(--muted)':barColor}">${x.score===null?'&mdash;':x.score+'%'}</strong></div></div>`}).join('')}</div>`:'<div class="empty">Add students to see attendance scores.</div>' ;state.attendanceData={roster,days,records}}
window.addAttendanceDay=async()=>{const classroomId=state.attendanceClassroomId,date=state.attendanceDate;if(!date)return toast('Choose a date first.');const {data:day,error}=await client.from('classroom_attendance_days').upsert({classroom_id:classroomId,attendance_date:date},{onConflict:'classroom_id,attendance_date'}).select().single();if(error)return dbError(error);const {data:roster,error:rosterError}=await client.from('classroom_members').select('id').eq('classroom_id',classroomId);if(rosterError)return dbError(rosterError);if(roster.length){const {error:markError}=await client.from('classroom_attendance_records').upsert(roster.map(m=>({attendance_day_id:day.id,classroom_member_id:m.id,status:'absent'})),{onConflict:'attendance_day_id,classroom_member_id',ignoreDuplicates:true});if(markError)return dbError(markError)}toast('Attendance day added. Students start as absent; update each status.',true);await loadAttendanceData()};
window.markClassAttendance=async(memberId,status)=>{const day=(state.attendanceData.days||[]).find(d=>d.attendance_date===state.attendanceDate);if(!day)return toast('Add this attendance day first.');const {error}=await client.from('classroom_attendance_records').upsert({attendance_day_id:day.id,classroom_member_id:memberId,status,marked_at:new Date().toISOString()},{onConflict:'attendance_day_id,classroom_member_id'});if(error)return dbError(error);await loadAttendanceData()};
window.removeRosterStudent=async(id,name)=>{if(!confirm(`Remove ${name} from this classroom? Their attendance history will also be deleted.`))return;const {error}=await client.from('classroom_members').delete().eq('id',id);if(error)return dbError(error);toast('Student removed from the roster.',true);await loadAttendanceData()};
window.addRosterStudent=async()=>{const input=document.getElementById('new-student-name'),name=input.value.trim();if(!name)return toast('Type a student name.');const {data:member,error}=await client.from('classroom_members').upsert({classroom_id:state.attendanceClassroomId,nickname:name,student_name:name},{onConflict:'classroom_id,nickname'}).select('id,joined_at').single();if(error)return dbError(error);const {data:days,error:daysError}=await client.from('classroom_attendance_days').select('id,attendance_date').eq('classroom_id',state.attendanceClassroomId);if(daysError)return dbError(daysError);const enrolled=member.joined_at.slice(0,10),eligible=(days||[]).filter(d=>d.attendance_date>=enrolled);if(eligible.length){const {error:recordError}=await client.from('classroom_attendance_records').upsert(eligible.map(d=>({attendance_day_id:d.id,classroom_member_id:member.id,status:'absent'})),{onConflict:'attendance_day_id,classroom_member_id',ignoreDuplicates:true});if(recordError)return dbError(recordError)}toast('Student added to the roster.',true);renderAttendance(document.getElementById('page-content'))};
window.deleteClassroom=async id=>{const classroom=state.classrooms.find(c=>c.id===id);if(!classroom)return;if(!confirm(`Delete classroom ${classroom.name}? Its sessions, roster, attendance records, and reports will also be deleted.`))return;const {error}=await client.from('classrooms').delete().eq('id',id);if(error)return dbError(error);if(state.attendanceClassroomId===id)state.attendanceClassroomId='';toast('Classroom and its records deleted.',true);await loadData();renderPage()};
function renderClassrooms(root){root.innerHTML=`<div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your teaching spaces</p><h1>My classrooms</h1><p class="subtext">Manage classrooms, student rosters, and attendance.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="openClassModal()">+ Create classroom</button></div>${state.classrooms.length?`<div class="grid class-grid">${state.classrooms.map(c=>`<div class="card class-card"><span class="tag">${esc(c.grade_level||'CLASSROOM')}</span><h3>${esc(c.name)}</h3><div class="subject">${esc(c.subject||'Subject not set')}</div>${c.description?`<p style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5">${esc(c.description)}</p>`:''}<div class="class-meta"><span> ${c.classroom_members?.[0]?.count||0} students</span></div><div style="margin-top:13px;display:flex;gap:8px"><button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="openSessionModal('${c.id}')">Start session</button><button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" onclick="openAttendance('${c.id}')">Roster & attendance</button><button class="btn btn-danger btn-sm" onclick="deleteClassroom('${c.id}')">Delete</button></div></div>`).join('')}</div>`:`<div class="card empty"><div class="empty-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5"/><rect x="13" y="3" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5"/><rect x="3" y="13" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5"/><rect x="13" y="13" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5"/></g></svg></div><strong>No classrooms yet</strong><p>Create a classroom and invite your students to join.</p><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="openClassModal()">Create your first classroom</button></div>`}`}
function renderSessions(root){root.innerHTML=`<div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Live classroom interaction</p><h1>Sessions</h1><p class="subtext">Start a room for students to check in, ask, and respond together.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="openSessionModal()">+ Start a session</button></div>${state.sessions.length?`<div class="grid">${state.sessions.map(s=>`<div class="card session-list-row" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:15px"><div style="display:flex;gap:13px;align-items:center"><div class="session-color"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="m10 8 6 4-6 4z"/></g></svg></div><div><strong style="display:block;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:5px">${esc(s.title)}</strong><small style="font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)">${esc(s.classrooms?.name||'Classroom')} &middot; ${dateFmt(s.created_at)}</small></div></div><div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center"><span class="${s.status==='live'?'live-pill':'tag'}">${esc(s.status.toUpperCase())}</span><button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" onclick="openSession('${s.id}')">${s.status==='ended'?'View report':'Open session'}</button>${s.status==='ended'?`<button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="restartSession('${s.id}')">Restart session</button>`:''}<button class="btn btn-danger btn-sm" onclick="deleteSession('${s.id}')">Delete</button></div></div>`).join('')}</div>`:`<div class="card empty"><div class="empty-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="m10 8 6 4-6 4z"/></g></svg></div><strong>No sessions yet</strong><p>Create a session from one of your classrooms to get started.</p><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="openSessionModal()">Start a session</button></div>`}`}
function renderLiveSession(root){const s=state.selected,all=state.meter.green+state.meter.yellow+state.meter.red;const pct=k=>all?Math.round(state.meter[k]/all*100):0;let warn=state.meter.red>=Math.ceil(Math.max(all,1)*.65)&&all>0?'Many students are still confused. Consider pausing to explain this topic again.':state.meter.yellow>state.meter.green?'Several students need another example. A quick worked example may help.':all?'Most responses show students understand so far.':'Check-in results will appear as students respond.';root.innerHTML=`<div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">${esc(s.classrooms?.name||'Classroom')} &middot; ${s.status==='live'?'Live now':esc(s.status)}</p><h1>${esc(s.title)}</h1><p class="subtext">${esc(s.topic||s.subject||'Lesson check-in')} &middot; Share the session code with your students.</p></div><button class="btn btn-outline" onclick="navigate('sessions')">&larr; All sessions</button></div><div class="session-banner"><div><h2>Students, join this session</h2><p id="join-link-label">Open the share link or enter the code below</p><button class="btn btn-quiet btn-sm" id="copy-join-link" style="margin-top:9px">Copy join link</button></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px"><div id="session-qr" style="background:white;padding:5px;border-radius:7px"></div><span class="code-display">${esc(s.join_code)}</span><button class="btn btn-quiet btn-sm" onclick="copyText('${esc(s.join_code)}')">Copy code</button></div></div><section class="grid stats"><div class="card"><span class="stat-label">Connected students</span><div class="stat-row"><strong class="stat-value">${state.participants.length}</strong><span class="stat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="15" rx="2"/><path d="M8 3v4m8-4v4M4 9h16m-11 4 2 2 4-4"/></g></svg></span></div></div><div class="card"><span class="stat-label">Understanding check-ins</span><div class="stat-row"><strong class="stat-value">${all}</strong><span class="stat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.4 8.4 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-.9-3.8A8.5 8.5 0 0 1 8.7 4a8.4 8.4 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.5 8.5 0 0 1 8 8z"/></g></svg></span></div></div><div class="card"><span class="stat-label">Anonymous questions</span><div class="stat-row"><strong class="stat-value">${state.questions.filter(q=>!q.answered_at).length}</strong><span class="stat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 7v14m0-14C10.5 5.7 8.5 5 6 5S2 5.7 2 7v12c0-1.3 1.5-2 4-2s4 .7 6 2m0-12c1.5-1.3 3.5-2 6-2s4 .7 4 2v12c0-1.3-1.5-2-4-2s-4 .7-6 2"/></g></svg></span></div></div><div class="card"><span class="stat-label">Status</span><div class="stat-row"><strong class="stat-value" style="font-size:18px">${esc(s.status)}</strong><span class="stat-icon" style="background:#e9f8f0;color:#199b70"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.4 8.4 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-.9-3.8A8.5 8.5 0 0 1 8.7 4a8.4 8.4 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.5 8.5 0 0 1 8 8z"/></g></svg></span></div></div></section><section class="grid two-col"><div class="card"><div class="section-head"><h2>Understanding meter</h2><button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" onclick="launchMeter()">Ask for a check-in</button></div><p class="subtext">Student responses are private. Only class totals appear here.</p><div class="meter-bars">${[['green','Understand','var(--green)'],['yellow','Need more examples','var(--yellow)'],['red','Need more support','var(--red)']].map(([k,l,c])=>`<div class="meter-row"><span class="meter-label"><i style="background:${c}"></i>${l}</span><span class="bar"><i style="width:${pct(k)}%"></i></span><strong>${pct(k)}%</strong></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="warning">${esc(warn)}</div></div><div class="card"><div class="section-head"><h2>Session controls</h2></div><div style="display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap"><button class="btn ${s.status==='paused'?'btn-primary':'btn-quiet'}" onclick="setSessionStatus('${s.status==='paused'?'live':'paused'}')">${s.status==='paused'?' Resume session':' Pause session'}</button><button class="btn btn-outline" onclick="openPollModal()">+ Create a poll</button><button class="btn btn-danger" onclick="endSession()">End session</button><button class="btn btn-danger" onclick="deleteSession('${s.id}')">Delete session</button></div><p style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;margin-top:16px">${state.participants.length} students have joined. New check-ins and questions appear here automatically.</p><hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin:17px 0"><div class="section-head"><h2>Active polls</h2><button class="link" onclick="openPollModal()">Create poll &rarr;</button></div>${state.polls.filter(p=>!p.quiz_set_id).length?state.polls.filter(p=>!p.quiz_set_id).map(renderPollResults).join(''):'<div class="empty" style="padding:13px">No polls yet.</div>'}</div></section>${renderQuizLibrary()}<section class="card" style="margin-top:17px"><div class="section-head"><h2>Anonymous questions</h2><span class="tag">${state.questions.filter(q=>!q.answered_at).length} NEED A RESPONSE</span></div>${state.questions.length?state.questions.map(q=>`<div class="question-item"><p>${esc(q.body)}</p><div class="question-meta"><span>${q.answered_at?'&#10003; Answered':'Anonymous &middot; '+dateFmt(q.created_at)}</span><span style="display:flex;gap:7px">${q.pinned?'<span class="tag">PINNED</span>':''}${!q.answered_at?`<button class="btn btn-quiet btn-sm" onclick="respondQuestion('${q.id}')">Respond</button><button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" onclick="togglePin('${q.id}',${!q.pinned})">${q.pinned?'Unpin':'Pin'}</button><button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="answerQuestion('${q.id}')">Mark answered</button>`:''}</span></div>${q.teacher_response?`<div class="success-msg" style="margin:12px 0 0">Teacher response: ${esc(q.teacher_response)}</div>`:''}</div>`).join(''):'<div class="empty">Questions from students will show up here.</div>'}</section>`;const joinUrl=location.origin+location.pathname+'?code='+encodeURIComponent(s.join_code)+'#join';const label=document.getElementById('join-link-label');if(label)label.textContent=joinUrl;const copyLink=document.getElementById('copy-join-link');if(copyLink)copyLink.onclick=()=>copyText(joinUrl);const qr=document.getElementById('session-qr');if(qr&&window.QRCode)new QRCode(qr,{text:joinUrl,width:66,height:66});startQuizCountdowns();applyLanguage(app)}
﻿function pollMeta(p){let html='';if(p.activity_type==='quiz'){html+='<span class="tag quiz-tag">QUIZ</span>';if(p.question_number&&p.question_count)html+='<small class="quiz-timer-label">Question '+p.question_number+' of '+p.question_count+'</small>';if(p.duration_seconds)html+='<small class="quiz-timer-label">This question: '+p.duration_seconds+' sec</small>';if(p.deadline_at&&p.status==='open')html+='<small class="quiz-timer-label">Time left: <span class="quiz-countdown" data-deadline="'+esc(p.deadline_at)+'" data-poll-id="'+p.id+'" data-quiz-set-question="'+(p.quiz_set_id?'true':'false')+'"></span></small>'}if(p.image_url)html+='<img class="quiz-image" src="'+esc(p.image_url)+'" alt="Quiz question image">';return html}
function renderPollResults(p){const total=p.poll_responses?.length||0;return `<div style="padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)"><strong style="font-size:12px">${esc(p.question)}</strong>${pollMeta(p)}<span class="tag" style="float:right">${p.status==='open'&&(!p.deadline_at||Date.parse(p.deadline_at)>Date.now())?'OPEN':'CLOSED'}</span>${p.poll_options.map(o=>{const n=p.poll_responses.filter(r=>r.option_id===o.id).length,pc=total?Math.round(n/total*100):0;return `<div class="poll-option"><span>${esc(o.label)} ${p.activity_type==='quiz'&&o.is_correct?'<span class="tag correct-answer-tag">Correct answer</span>':''} <b>${n} &middot; ${pc}%</b></span><div class="bar"><i style="width:${pc}%;background:var(--blue)"></i></div></div>`}).join('')}<small style="color:var(--muted);font-size:10px">${total} responses</small>${p.status==='open'&&(!p.deadline_at||Date.parse(p.deadline_at)>Date.now())?` <button class="btn btn-quiet btn-sm" onclick="closePoll('${p.id}')">Close voting</button>`:''} <button class="btn btn-danger btn-sm" onclick="deletePoll('${p.id}')">Delete poll</button></div>`}
function renderQuestions(root){const qs=state.sessions.flatMap(s=>[]);root.innerHTML=`<div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Student voice</p><h1>Anonymous questions</h1><p class="subtext">Questions from your live sessions. Students remain anonymous to their classmates.</p></div></div><div class="card empty"><div class="empty-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.4 8.4 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-.9-3.8A8.5 8.5 0 0 1 8.7 4a8.4 8.4 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.5 8.5 0 0 1 8 8z"/></g></svg></div><strong>Open a live session to review questions</strong><p>Select a session to see submissions and respond.</p><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="navigate('sessions')">Go to sessions</button></div>`}
function renderAnalytics(root){root.innerHTML=`<div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your classroom pulse</p><h1>Engagement insights</h1><p class="subtext">Calculated from actual student responses in completed and active sessions.</p></div></div><div class="card empty"><div class="empty-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 7v14m0-14C10.5 5.7 8.5 5 6 5S2 5.7 2 7v12c0-1.3 1.5-2 4-2s4 .7 6 2m0-12c1.5-1.3 3.5-2 6-2s4 .7 4 2v12c0-1.3-1.5-2-4-2s-4 .7-6 2"/></g></svg></div><strong>Insights show up after students participate</strong><p>Start a live session and use the understanding meter or polls. Results will be calculated from their responses.</p><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="openSessionModal()">Start a session</button></div>`}
function renderReports(root){const ended=state.sessions.filter(s=>s.status==='ended');root.innerHTML=`<div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your teaching notes</p><h1>Session reports</h1><p class="subtext">Review the understanding checks, polls, and questions from past sessions.</p></div></div>${ended.length?ended.map(s=>`<div class="card report-card" style="margin:10px 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center"><div><strong>${esc(s.title)}</strong><p class="subtext" style="margin-top:7px">${esc(s.classrooms?.name||'Classroom')} &middot; ${dateFmt(s.ended_at||s.created_at)}</p></div><div style="display:flex;gap:8px"><button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" onclick="openSession('${s.id}')">Open report</button><button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="restartSession('${s.id}')">Restart session</button><button class="btn btn-danger btn-sm" onclick="deleteSession('${s.id}')">Delete</button></div></div>`).join(''):'<div class="card empty"><div class="empty-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8m-8 4h8"/></g></svg></div><strong>No reports yet</strong><p>End a live session to save its report.</p></div>'}`}
function openModal(title,subtitle,body,submitText,submitAction){const root=document.getElementById('modal-root');root.innerHTML=`<div class="modal-backdrop" onclick="if(event.target===this)closeModal()"><div class="modal"><div class="modal-head"><div><h2>${esc(title)}</h2><p>${esc(subtitle)}</p></div><button class="close" onclick="closeModal()">&times;</button></div><div id="modal-body">${body}</div><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn btn-quiet" onclick="closeModal()">Cancel</button><button class="btn btn-primary" id="modal-submit">${submitText}</button></div></div></div>`;document.getElementById('modal-submit').onclick=submitAction;applyLanguage(app)}
window.closeModal=()=>document.getElementById('modal-root').innerHTML='';
window.openClassModal=()=>openModal('Create a classroom','Set up a space for a subject or group.',`<div class="field"><label>Classroom name</label><input id="f-name" placeholder="e.g. Grade 8 Mathematics"></div><div class="inline-fields"><div class="field"><label>Subject</label><input id="f-subject" placeholder="Mathematics"></div><div class="field"><label>Grade / level</label><input id="f-grade" placeholder="Grade 8"></div></div><div class="field"><label>Description (optional)</label><textarea id="f-desc" placeholder="A little about this group"></textarea></div>`,'Create classroom',createClassroom);
async function createClassroom(){const name=document.getElementById('f-name').value.trim();if(!name)return toast('Add a classroom name.');const {error}=await client.from('classrooms').insert({teacher_id:state.user.id,name,subject:document.getElementById('f-subject').value.trim()||null,grade_level:document.getElementById('f-grade').value.trim()||null,description:document.getElementById('f-desc').value.trim()||null});if(error)return dbError(error);closeModal();toast('Classroom created.',true);await loadData();navigate('classrooms')}
window.openSessionModal=(classroomId='')=>{if(!state.classrooms.length)return toast('Create a classroom before starting a session.');openModal('Start a live session','Students can join using the code or shareable link.',`<div class="field"><label>Session title</label><input id="s-title" placeholder="e.g. Fractions: a quick check-in"></div><div class="inline-fields"><div class="field"><label>Classroom</label><select id="s-class">${state.classrooms.map(c=>`<option value="${c.id}" ${c.id===classroomId?'selected':''}>${esc(c.name)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>Subject</label><input id="s-subject" placeholder="Mathematics"></div></div><div class="field"><label>Lesson topic</label><input id="s-topic" placeholder="What are you covering today?"></div><div class="field"><label>Description (optional)</label><textarea id="s-desc" placeholder="A note for your students"></textarea></div>`,'Create session',createSession)};
window.deleteSession=async id=>{const session=state.sessions.find(s=>s.id===id)||state.selected;if(!session||session.id!==id)return;if(!confirm('Delete session "'+session.title+'"? This permanently removes its participants, responses, questions, polls, and report. Students in the session will lose access.'))return;const {error}=await client.from('sessions').delete().eq('id',id);if(error)return dbError(error);if(state.channel){state.channel.unsubscribe();state.channel=null}if(state.selected?.id===id)state.selected=null;if(state.view==='session')state.view='sessions';toast('Session and its related data deleted.',true);await loadData();renderPage()};
window.restartSession=async id=>{const previous=state.sessions.find(s=>s.id===id);if(!previous||previous.status!=='ended')return toast('Only ended sessions can be restarted.');const {data,error}=await client.from('sessions').insert({teacher_id:state.user.id,classroom_id:previous.classroom_id,title:previous.title,subject:previous.subject,topic:previous.topic,description:previous.description,status:'live'}).select('id').single();if(error)return dbError(error);toast('A fresh session has started with a new join code.',true);await loadData();openSession(data.id)};
async function createSession(){const title=document.getElementById('s-title').value.trim(),class_id=document.getElementById('s-class').value;if(!title)return toast('Add a session title.');const {data,error}=await client.from('sessions').insert({teacher_id:state.user.id,classroom_id:class_id,title,subject:document.getElementById('s-subject').value.trim()||null,topic:document.getElementById('s-topic').value.trim()||null,description:document.getElementById('s-desc').value.trim()||null,status:'live'}).select('*,classrooms(name)').single();if(error)return dbError(error);closeModal();toast('Session is live. Share the code with students.',true);await loadData();openSession(data.id)}
window.openSession=id=>{const session=state.sessions.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!session)return toast('This session is no longer in the list.');state.selected=session;state.view='session';state.meter={green:0,yellow:0,red:0};state.questions=[];state.polls=[];state.participants=[];state.quizSets=[];state.quizTablesReady=true;if(state.channel){state.channel.unsubscribe();state.channel=null}state.channel=client.channel('teacher-'+id).on('postgres_changes',{event:'*',schema:'public',table:'understanding_responses',filter:'session_id=eq.'+id},()=>refreshSession()).on('postgres_changes',{event:'*',schema:'public',table:'questions',filter:'session_id=eq.'+id},()=>refreshSession()).on('postgres_changes',{event:'*',schema:'public',table:'poll_responses'},()=>refreshSession()).on('postgres_changes',{event:'*',schema:'public',table:'session_participants',filter:'session_id=eq.'+id},()=>refreshSession()).subscribe();renderPage();loadSessionData(id).then(()=>{if(state.selected?.id===id&&state.view==='session')renderPage()}).catch(dbError)};
async function refreshSession(){if(state.selected){await loadSessionData(state.selected.id);renderPage()}}
window.setSessionStatus=async status=>{const {error}=await client.from('sessions').update({status}).eq('id',state.selected.id);if(error)return dbError(error);state.selected.status=status;await loadData();toast(status==='live'?'Session resumed.':'Session paused.',true);renderPage()};
window.endSession=async()=>{if(!confirm('End this session? Students will no longer be able to respond.'))return;await loadSessionData(state.selected.id);const result={participants:state.participants.length,checkins:state.meter,questions:state.questions.length,polls:state.polls.length};const {error}=await client.from('sessions').update({status:'ended',ended_at:new Date().toISOString()}).eq('id',state.selected.id);if(error)return dbError(error);const {error:reportError}=await client.from('session_reports').upsert({session_id:state.selected.id,teacher_id:state.user.id,summary:result},{onConflict:'session_id'});if(reportError)return dbError(reportError);if(state.channel){state.channel.unsubscribe();state.channel=null}await loadData();state.selected=state.sessions.find(s=>s.id===state.selected.id);state.view='reports';const closedAt=new Date().toISOString();await client.from('quiz_sets').update({status:'ended',ended_at:closedAt}).eq('session_id',state.selected.id).eq('status','live');await client.from('polls').update({status:'closed'}).eq('session_id',state.selected.id).not('quiz_set_id','is',null);toast('Session ended. Its report is ready.',true);renderPage()};
window.launchMeter=async()=>{const {error}=await client.from('sessions').update({active_prompt:'understanding',prompt_open:true}).eq('id',state.selected.id);if(error)return dbError(error);toast('Understanding check is live for students.',true)};
﻿function renderQuizPerformance(set,questions){if(set.status!=='ended')return '';if(!questions.length)return '<p class="subtext">No questions were added to this quiz.</p>';const ids=new Set(questions.map(q=>q.id));const participants=state.participants.filter(student=>(!set.ended_at||!student.joined_at||new Date(student.joined_at)<=new Date(set.ended_at))&&state.quizAttempts.some(a=>ids.has(a.poll_id)&&a.participant_id===student.id)).map(student=>{const attempts=state.quizAttempts.filter(a=>ids.has(a.poll_id)&&a.participant_id===student.id),correct=attempts.filter(a=>a.is_correct).length;return {...student,correct,score:Math.round(correct/questions.length*100)}}).sort((a,b)=>b.score-a.score||b.correct-a.correct||a.nickname.localeCompare(b.nickname));const podium=participants.slice(0,3).map((student,index)=>`<li><span><b>${index+1}.</b> ${esc(student.nickname)}</span><strong>${student.score}%</strong></li>`).join('');const rows=participants.map(student=>`<tr><td>${esc(student.nickname)}</td><td>${student.correct} / ${questions.length}</td><td><strong>${student.score}%</strong></td></tr>`).join('');return `<div class="quiz-performance"><h3>Top 3 scorers</h3>${podium?`<ol class="quiz-podium">${podium}</ol>`:'<p class="subtext">No students answered this quiz.</p>'}<h3>All participating students</h3><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Student</th><th>Correct</th><th>Score</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows||'<tr><td colspan="3">No participants.</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div></div>`}
function renderQuizLibrary(){if(!state.quizTablesReady)return `<section class="card quiz-library"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Quiz folders</h2><p class="subtext">Run supabase/add_live_quizzes.sql in Supabase to enable quiz folders.</p></div></div></section>`;const sets=state.quizSets||[];return `<section class="card quiz-library"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Quiz folders</h2><p class="subtext">Group questions into a set, then launch them in order.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="openQuizSetModal()">Create quiz folder</button></div>${sets.length?sets.map(set=>{const questions=state.polls.filter(p=>p.quiz_set_id===set.id).sort((a,b)=>(a.quiz_order??0)-(b.quiz_order??0));return `<article class="quiz-set-card"><div class="quiz-set-heading"><div><strong data-no-translate="true">${esc(set.title)}</strong><div class="quiz-set-summary"><span>${questions.length} question${questions.length===1?'':'s'}</span><span class="quiz-set-timing">Timer set per question</span></div></div><span class="tag">${esc(set.status.toUpperCase())}</span></div>${questions.length?`<div class="quiz-question-list">${questions.map((q,index)=>`<div class="quiz-question-row"><div class="quiz-question-copy"><strong>Question ${index+1}</strong><span data-no-translate="true">${esc(q.question)}</span>${q.image_url?`<img src="${esc(q.image_url)}" alt="" class="quiz-question-thumb">`:''}</div><div class="quiz-question-details"><span class="quiz-correct-answer"><b>Correct answer</b> <span data-no-translate="true">${esc(q.poll_options.find(o=>o.is_correct)?.label||'Not set')}</span></span><span class="quiz-timer-badge">${q.duration_seconds?`${q.duration_seconds} sec`:'No timer'}</span></div></div>`).join('')}</div>`:''}<div class="quiz-set-actions">${set.status==='draft'?`<button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" onclick="addQuizQuestion('${set.id}')">Add question</button><button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" ${questions.length?'':'disabled'} onclick="launchQuizSet('${set.id}')">Launch quiz</button>`:''}${set.status==='live'?`<button class="btn btn-danger btn-sm" onclick="endQuizSet('${set.id}')">End quiz</button>`:''}${set.status==='ended'&&state.selected.status==='live'?`<button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" onclick="restartQuizSet('${set.id}')">Restart quiz</button>`:''}<button class="btn btn-quiet btn-sm" onclick="deleteQuizSet('${set.id}')">Delete folder</button></div>${renderQuizPerformance(set,questions)}</article>`}).join(''):'<div class="empty quiz-library-empty">No quiz folders yet. Create one, add questions, then launch it for your students.</div>'}</section>`}
window.openQuizSetModal=()=>openModal('Create a quiz folder','Add questions to this folder, then launch the set for students.',`<div class="field"><label>Quiz folder name</label><input id="quiz-set-title" placeholder="e.g. Fractions review"></div><p class="subtext">Set a timer for each question when you add it.</p>`,'Create folder',createQuizSet);
async function createQuizSet(){const title=document.getElementById('quiz-set-title').value.trim(),submit=document.getElementById('modal-submit');if(title.length<2)return toast('Enter a quiz folder name.');if(!state.selected||!state.user)return toast('Open a teacher session before creating a quiz folder.');if(submit){submit.disabled=true;submit.textContent='Creating folder...'}const makeId=()=>globalThis.crypto?.randomUUID?globalThis.crypto.randomUUID():'xxxxxxxx-xxxx-4xxx-yxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx'.replace(/[xy]/g,c=>{const r=Math.random()*16|0;return(c==='x'?r:(r&3|8)).toString(16)});const folder={id:makeId(),session_id:state.selected.id,teacher_id:state.user.id,title,status:'draft',duration_seconds:null,created_at:new Date().toISOString()};try{const {error}=await client.from('quiz_sets').insert(folder);if(error){if(['42P01','PGRST205'].includes(error.code)){state.quizTablesReady=false;closeModal();renderPage()}else if(submit){submit.disabled=false;submit.textContent='Create folder'}return dbError(error)}state.quizTablesReady=true;state.quizSets=[folder,...(state.quizSets||[])];state.activeQuizSetId=folder.id;closeModal();renderPage();toast('Folder created. Add your first question.',true);openQuizModal()}catch(error){if(submit){submit.disabled=false;submit.textContent='Create folder'}dbError(error)}}
window.addQuizQuestion=id=>{state.activeQuizSetId=id;openQuizModal()};
window.openQuizModal=()=>openModal('Add a quiz question','Students will answer each question in order.',`<div class="field"><label>Question</label><input id="quiz-question" placeholder="e.g. Which shape has four equal sides?"></div><div class="field"><label>Answer choices (one per line)</label><textarea id="quiz-options" style="min-height:110px" placeholder="Square\nRectangle\nTriangle\nCircle"></textarea></div><div class="field"><label>Timer for this question</label><select id="quiz-question-duration"><option value="5">5 seconds</option><option value="10" selected>10 seconds</option><option value="15">15 seconds</option><option value="20">20 seconds</option><option value="30">30 seconds</option><option value="45">45 seconds</option><option value="60">1 minute</option><option value="90">90 seconds</option><option value="120">2 minutes</option><option value="180">3 minutes</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Correct answer</label><select id="quiz-correct-index"><option value="1">Choice 1</option><option value="2">Choice 2</option><option value="3">Choice 3</option><option value="4">Choice 4</option><option value="5">Choice 5</option><option value="6">Choice 6</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Question image (optional, max 5 MB)</label><input id="quiz-image-file" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/gif" onchange="previewQuizImage(this)"><div id="quiz-image-preview"></div></div>`,'Save question',createQuiz);
window.previewQuizImage=input=>{const box=document.getElementById('quiz-image-preview'),file=input.files?.[0];if(!file){box.innerHTML='';return}if(file.size>5242880){input.value='';box.textContent='Image must be 5 MB or smaller.';return}box.innerHTML='<img class="quiz-image-preview" src="'+URL.createObjectURL(file)+'" alt="Quiz image preview">'};
window.createQuiz=async()=>{const set=state.quizSets.find(x=>x.id===state.activeQuizSetId);if(!set||set.status!=='draft')return toast('Choose a draft quiz folder first.');const question=document.getElementById('quiz-question').value.trim(),options=document.getElementById('quiz-options').value.split('\n').map(x=>x.trim()).filter(Boolean),correctIndex=Number(document.getElementById('quiz-correct-index').value),duration=Number(document.getElementById('quiz-question-duration').value),file=document.getElementById('quiz-image-file').files?.[0];if(!question||options.length<2||correctIndex<1||correctIndex>options.length)return toast('Add at least two choices and select a valid correct answer.');if(file&&(!['image/jpeg','image/png','image/webp','image/gif'].includes(file.type)||file.size>5242880))return toast('Choose a JPG, PNG, WebP, or GIF image up to 5 MB.');let imageUrl=null;if(file){const safeName=file.name.replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9._-]/g,'_'),path=state.user.id+'/'+state.selected.id+'/'+crypto.randomUUID()+'-'+safeName;const {error:uploadError}=await client.storage.from('quiz-images').upload(path,file,{cacheControl:'3600',upsert:false,contentType:file.type});if(uploadError)return dbError(uploadError);imageUrl=client.storage.from('quiz-images').getPublicUrl(path).data.publicUrl}const order=state.polls.filter(p=>p.quiz_set_id===set.id).length;const {data,error}=await client.from('polls').insert({session_id:state.selected.id,teacher_id:state.user.id,question,status:'closed',reveal_results:true,activity_type:'quiz',quiz_set_id:set.id,quiz_order:order,duration_seconds:duration,deadline_at:null,image_url:imageUrl}).select().single();if(error)return dbError(error);const optionRows=options.map((label,sort_order)=>({poll_id:data.id,label,sort_order,is_correct:sort_order+1===correctIndex}));const {data:savedOptions,error:optionsError}=await client.from('poll_options').insert(optionRows).select();if(optionsError){await client.from('polls').delete().eq('id',data.id);return dbError(optionsError)}state.polls.unshift({...data,poll_options:savedOptions||optionRows,poll_responses:[]});closeModal();toast('Question added to the quiz folder.',true);renderPage();const sessionId=state.selected.id;loadSessionData(sessionId).then(()=>{if(state.selected?.id===sessionId&&state.view==='session')renderPage()}).catch(dbError)};
window.launchQuizSet=async id=>{const set=state.quizSets.find(x=>x.id===id),questions=state.polls.filter(p=>p.quiz_set_id===id);if(!set||!questions.length)return toast('Add at least one question before launching.');if(state.selected.status!=='live')return toast('Resume the live session before launching a quiz.');const startedAt=new Date(),deadlineAt=null;const {error}=await client.from('quiz_sets').update({status:'live',started_at:startedAt.toISOString(),deadline_at:deadlineAt,ended_at:null}).eq('id',id);if(error)return dbError(error);const {error:pollError}=await client.from('polls').update({status:'open'}).eq('quiz_set_id',id);if(pollError)return dbError(pollError);toast('Quiz launched. Students will answer in order.',true);await loadSessionData(state.selected.id);renderPage()};
window.endQuizSet=async(id,expired=false)=>{const set=state.quizSets.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!set||set.status!=='live')return;if(!expired&&!confirm('End this quiz now? Students will stop answering and scores will be saved.'))return;const endedAt=new Date().toISOString();const {error}=await client.from('quiz_sets').update({status:'ended',ended_at:endedAt}).eq('id',id);if(error)return dbError(error);const {error:pollError}=await client.from('polls').update({status:'closed'}).eq('quiz_set_id',id);if(pollError)return dbError(pollError);toast(expired?'Quiz timer ended. Scores are ready.':'Quiz ended. Student scores are ready.',true);await loadSessionData(state.selected.id);renderPage()};
window.restartQuizSet=async id=>{const set=state.quizSets.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!set||set.status!=='ended')return;if(!confirm('Restart “'+set.title+'”? This clears the previous attempts and scores for this quiz folder.'))return;const {error}=await client.rpc('teacher_restart_quiz_set',{p_set:id});if(error)return dbError(error);toast('Quiz restarted. Students can begin again.',true);await loadSessionData(state.selected.id);renderPage()};
window.deleteQuizSet=async id=>{const set=state.quizSets.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!set)return;if(!confirm('Delete quiz folder "'+set.title+'" and all its questions and answers?'))return;const {error}=await client.from('quiz_sets').delete().eq('id',id);if(error)return dbError(error);toast('Quiz folder deleted.',true);await loadSessionData(state.selected.id);renderPage()};
function startQuizCountdowns(studentMode=false){if(state.quizCountdown)clearInterval(state.quizCountdown);const update=()=>{document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-countdown').forEach(el=>{const left=Math.max(0,Math.ceil((Date.parse(el.dataset.deadline)-Date.now())/1000));el.textContent=left?left+' sec':'Time is up';if(!left&&!el.dataset.expiring){el.dataset.expiring='true';if(studentMode)refreshStudentRoom();else if(el.dataset.quizSetQuestion!=='true'&&el.dataset.pollId)closePoll(el.dataset.pollId)}});document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-set-countdown').forEach(el=>{const left=Math.max(0,Math.ceil((Date.parse(el.dataset.deadline)-Date.now())/1000));el.textContent=left?left+' sec':'Time is up';if(!left&&el.dataset.quizSetId&&!el.dataset.expiring){el.dataset.expiring='true';endQuizSet(el.dataset.quizSetId,true)}})};update();state.quizCountdown=setInterval(update,1000)};
window.openPollModal=()=>openModal('Create a quick poll','Keep it simple—students can vote from their session screen.',`<div class="field"><label>Question</label><input id="p-question" placeholder="What should we practice next?"></div><div class="field"><label>Answer options (one per line)</label><textarea id="p-options" style="min-height:115px" placeholder="Adding fractions\nSubtracting fractions\nWord problems"></textarea></div><div class="field"><label><input type="checkbox" id="p-reveal" checked style="width:auto;margin-right:7px">Show results to students after voting</label></div>`,'Launch poll',createPoll);
async function createPoll(){const question=document.getElementById('p-question').value.trim(),options=document.getElementById('p-options').value.split('\n').map(x=>x.trim()).filter(Boolean);if(!question||options.length<2)return toast('Add a question and at least two answer options.');const {data,error}=await client.from('polls').insert({session_id:state.selected.id,teacher_id:state.user.id,question,status:'open',reveal_results:document.getElementById('p-reveal').checked}).select().single();if(error)return dbError(error);const {error:e}=await client.from('poll_options').insert(options.map(label=>({poll_id:data.id,label})));if(e)return dbError(e);closeModal();toast('Poll is live.',true);await loadSessionData(state.selected.id);renderPage()}
window.closePoll=async id=>{const {error}=await client.from('polls').update({status:'closed'}).eq('id',id);if(error)return dbError(error);await refreshSession()};
window.deletePoll=async id=>{const poll=state.polls.find(p=>p.id===id);if(!poll)return;if(!confirm('Delete this poll and all of its student responses? This cannot be undone.'))return;const {error}=await client.from('polls').delete().eq('id',id);if(error)return dbError(error);toast('Poll and its responses deleted.',true);await refreshSession()};
window.answerQuestion=async id=>{const {error}=await client.from('questions').update({answered_at:new Date().toISOString()}).eq('id',id);if(error)return dbError(error);toast('Marked as answered.',true);await refreshSession()};
window.togglePin=async(id,pinned)=>{const {error}=await client.from('questions').update({pinned}).eq('id',id);if(error)return dbError(error);await refreshSession()};
window.respondQuestion=id=>openModal('Respond to student','Your response is visible to students in this session.',`<div class="field"><label>Your response</label><textarea id="q-response" placeholder="Write a clear, helpful answer..."></textarea></div>`,'Send response',async()=>{const response=document.getElementById('q-response').value.trim();if(!response)return toast('Write a response first.');const {error}=await client.from('questions').update({teacher_response:response,answered_at:new Date().toISOString()}).eq('id',id);if(error)return dbError(error);closeModal();toast('Response shared with the class.',true);await refreshSession()});
window.copyText=async text=>{try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);toast('Copied to clipboard.',true)}catch{toast('Copy unavailable. Code: '+text)}};
window.openSettings=()=>openModal('Your profile','Edit the name shown in your teacher workspace.',`<div class="field"><label>Display name</label><input id="profile-name" value="${esc(state.profile?.full_name||'')}"></div><div class="field"><label>Email address</label><input value="${esc(state.user.email)}" disabled></div>`,'Save changes',async()=>{const name=document.getElementById('profile-name').value.trim();if(!name)return toast('Add a display name.');const {error}=await client.from('profiles').update({full_name:name}).eq('id',state.user.id);if(error)return dbError(error);state.profile.full_name=name;closeModal();renderShell();toast('Profile updated.',true)});
function studentJoinScreen(code=''){app.innerHTML=`<div class="join-wrap"><div class="join-card"><div class="brand" style="padding:0"><span class="brand-mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 7v14m0-14C10.5 5.7 8.5 5 6 5S2 5.7 2 7v12c0-1.3 1.5-2 4-2s4 .7 6 2m0-12c1.5-1.3 3.5-2 6-2s4 .7 4 2v12c0-1.3-1.5-2-4-2s-4 .7-6 2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="brand-name">Vichea</span></div><h1>Join your class.</h1><p>Enter the code your teacher shared. No account needed.</p><div class="field"><label>Session code</label><input id="join-code" value="${esc(code)}" placeholder="e.g. 8K2M9P" maxlength="8" style="text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px"></div><div class="field"><label>Your nickname</label><input id="join-nick" placeholder="What should we call you?"></div><button class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%;margin-top:4px" onclick="joinSession()">Join session</button><p style="text-align:center;margin:18px 0 0;font-size:10px">Your nickname is only visible to your teacher.</p></div></div>`;applyLanguage(app)}
window.joinStudent=studentJoinScreen;
window.joinSession=async()=>{const code=document.getElementById('join-code').value.trim().toUpperCase(),nickname=document.getElementById('join-nick').value.trim();if(!code||!nickname)return toast('Enter the session code and a nickname.');const {data,error}=await client.rpc('join_session',{p_code:code,p_nickname:nickname});if(error)return dbError(error);const participant=Array.isArray(data)?data[0]:data;if(!participant)return toast('Could not join that session.');state.student={...participant,nickname,votes:{}};studentRoom()};
async function studentRoom(){if(!state.student)return;await refreshStudentRoom();if(state.channel)state.channel.unsubscribe();state.channel=client.channel('student-'+state.student.session_id).on('postgres_changes',{event:'*',schema:'public',table:'polls',filter:`session_id=eq.${state.student.session_id}`},()=>refreshStudentRoom()).on('postgres_changes',{event:'*',schema:'public',table:'questions',filter:`session_id=eq.${state.student.session_id}`},()=>refreshStudentRoom()).subscribe();if(state.studentTimer)clearInterval(state.studentTimer);state.studentTimer=setInterval(refreshStudentRoom,3000)}
async function refreshStudentRoom(){const s=state.student;if(!s)return;const [sessionResult,polls,questions,scores,leaderboard]=await Promise.all([client.rpc('student_session_view',{p_session:s.session_id,p_participant:s.id}),client.rpc('student_open_polls',{p_session:s.session_id,p_participant:s.id}),client.rpc('student_teacher_responses',{p_session:s.session_id,p_participant:s.id}),client.rpc('student_quiz_scores',{p_session:s.session_id,p_participant:s.id}),client.rpc('student_quiz_leaderboard',{p_session:s.session_id,p_participant:s.id})]);if(sessionResult.error)return dbError(sessionResult.error);if(scores.error&&!['42883','PGRST202','PGRST205'].includes(scores.error.code))return dbError(scores.error);const session=Array.isArray(sessionResult.data)?sessionResult.data[0]:sessionResult.data;if(!session)return toast('This session is no longer available.');state.student.session=session;state.student.polls=polls.data||[];if(state.student.polls.some(p=>p.activity_type==='quiz')&&Object.keys(state.student.completedQuizSets||{}).length){state.student.completedQuizSets={};state.student.votes={}}state.student.responses=questions.data||[];state.student.quizScores=scores.error?[]:(scores.data||[]);state.student.quizLeaderboard=leaderboard.error?[]:(leaderboard.data||[]);const draft=document.getElementById('student-question');const draftText=draft?.value??'';const wasFocused=draft===document.activeElement;const cursorStart=draft?.selectionStart??draftText.length;const cursorEnd=draft?.selectionEnd??draftText.length;renderStudentRoom();const nextDraft=document.getElementById('student-question');if(nextDraft){nextDraft.value=draftText;if(wasFocused){nextDraft.focus();nextDraft.setSelectionRange(cursorStart,cursorEnd)}}}
function renderStudentRoom(){const s=state.student.session,paused=s.status==='paused',ended=s.status==='ended';app.innerHTML=`<div class="student-shell"><div class="student-top"><div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 7v14m0-14C10.5 5.7 8.5 5 6 5S2 5.7 2 7v12c0-1.3 1.5-2 4-2s4 .7 6 2m0-12c1.5-1.3 3.5-2 6-2s4 .7 4 2v12c0-1.3-1.5-2-4-2s-4 .7-6 2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="brand-name">Vichea</span></div><span class="status-chip">${paused?'PAUSED':ended?'SESSION ENDED':'LIVE SESSION'}</span></div><div class="student-panel"><p class="eyebrow">${esc(s.classroom_name||'Your classroom')} &middot; ${esc(state.student.nickname)}</p><h2>${esc(s.title)}</h2><p>${esc(s.topic||s.description||'Take a moment to share how the lesson is going.')}</p></div>${paused?'<div class="warning">Your teacher has paused this session. Hang tight!</div>':''}${ended?'<div class="success-msg">This session has ended. Thanks for participating.</div>':''}${s.prompt_open&&!ended&&!paused?`<div class="student-panel"><h2>How are you feeling about this lesson?</h2><p>Your answer is private. Only your teacher sees the class totals.</p><div class="understanding-options">${[['green','I understand'],['yellow','More examples'],['red','Need support']].map(([k,l])=>`<button class="understanding-${k}" onclick="submitUnderstanding('${k}')"><span class="understanding-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>${l}</button>`).join('')}</div><div id="meter-saved"></div></div>`:''}${state.student.polls.filter(p=>p.status==='open').map(p=>`<div class="student-panel ${p.activity_type==='quiz'?'student-quiz-panel':''}" data-student-poll="${p.id}"><h2>${esc(p.question)}</h2>${pollMeta(p)}<div id="poll-${p.id}">${p.poll_options.map(o=>`<button class="answer-option ${state.student.votes?.[p.id]===o.id?'selected':''}" data-option-id="${o.id}" onclick="submitPoll('${p.id}','${o.id}')">${esc(o.label)}</button>`).join('')}</div></div>`).join('')}<div class="student-panel"><h2>Ask a question, anonymously</h2><p>Your teacher can see who joined, but your classmates won’t see your name with this question.</p><textarea id="student-question" placeholder="What would you like your teacher to explain?" style="width:100%;min-height:82px;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;font:12px 'DM Sans'"></textarea><button class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:10px" onclick="submitQuestion()">Send anonymously</button><div id="question-saved"></div></div>${state.student.completedQuizSets&&Object.keys(state.student.completedQuizSets).length?Object.values(state.student.completedQuizSets).map(title=>`<div class="student-panel quiz-finished-message"><h2>Quiz complete</h2><p>You finished <strong>${esc(title)}</strong>. Your teacher will reveal the class leaderboard when the quiz ends.</p></div>`).join(''):''}${state.student.responses.length?`<div class="student-panel"><h2>Teacher responses</h2>${state.student.responses.map(q=>`<div class="success-msg">${esc(q.teacher_response)}</div>`).join('')}</div>`:''}<div style="text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;padding:8px">You are in ${esc(s.classroom_name||'class')} &middot; code ${esc(s.join_code)}</div>${state.student.quizScores?.length?`<div class="student-panel student-leaderboard"><h2>Quiz results and leaderboard</h2>${state.student.quizScores.map(q=>{const leaders=state.student.quizLeaderboard.filter(row=>row.quiz_set_id===q.quiz_set_id);return `<section class="student-leaderboard-set"><div class="student-quiz-score"><span>${esc(q.title)} · Your score: ${q.correct_count}/${q.question_count} correct</span><strong>${q.score_percent}%</strong></div><h3>Class leaderboard</h3>${leaders.length?`<ol>${leaders.map(row=>`<li class="${row.participant_id===state.student.id?'your-rank':''}"><span><b>${row.rank}.</b> ${esc(row.nickname)}${row.participant_id===state.student.id?' (you)':''}</span><strong>${row.score_percent}%</strong></li>`).join('')}</ol>`:'<p class="subtext">No quiz participants to rank yet.</p>'}</section>`}).join('')}</div>`:''}</div>`;startQuizCountdowns(true);applyLanguage(app)}
window.submitUnderstanding=async response=>{const {error}=await client.rpc('submit_understanding',{p_session:state.student.session_id,p_participant:state.student.id,p_response:response});if(error)return dbError(error);document.getElementById('meter-saved').innerHTML='<div class="success-msg">Your check-in is saved. You can update it any time.</div>';toast('Thanks for checking in.',true)};
window.submitQuestion=async()=>{const body=document.getElementById('student-question').value.trim();if(body.length<4)return toast('Write a little more so your teacher can help.');const {error}=await client.rpc('submit_anonymous_question',{p_session:state.student.session_id,p_participant:state.student.id,p_body:body});if(error)return dbError(error);document.getElementById('student-question').value='';document.getElementById('question-saved').innerHTML='<div class="success-msg">Sent. Your teacher will see your question.</div>';toast('Question sent anonymously.',true)};
window.submitPoll=async(poll_id,option_id)=>{const poll=state.student.polls.find(p=>p.id===poll_id),isQuiz=poll?.activity_type==='quiz';if(state.student.submittingPoll)return;state.student.submittingPoll=poll_id;const panel=document.querySelector('[data-student-poll="'+poll_id+'"]');if(panel){panel.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(b=>{b.disabled=true;b.classList.toggle('selected',b.dataset.optionId===option_id)});if(isQuiz)panel.innerHTML='<div class="quiz-advance-loading"><span class="loading-dot"></span><strong>Submitting your answer…</strong></div>';else{const note=document.createElement('small');note.className='answer-saving';note.textContent='Saving your answer…';panel.append(note)}}const result=await client.rpc(isQuiz?'student_submit_quiz_answer':'submit_poll_response',isQuiz?{p_poll:poll_id,p_participant:state.student.id,p_option:option_id}:{p_poll:poll_id,p_participant:state.student.id,p_option:option_id});state.student.submittingPoll=null;if(result.error){await refreshStudentRoom();return dbError(result.error)}state.student.votes=state.student.votes||{};state.student.votes[poll_id]=option_id;if(isQuiz){const advance=result.data||{},next=advance.next_question;state.student.polls=state.student.polls.filter(p=>p.id!==poll_id);if(next)state.student.polls.unshift(next);if(advance.quiz_complete){state.student.completedQuizSets=state.student.completedQuizSets||{};state.student.completedQuizSets[advance.quiz_set_id]=advance.title}renderStudentRoom()}else{const saving=document.querySelector('[data-student-poll="'+poll_id+'"] .answer-saving');if(saving)saving.textContent='Your answer is saved.'}};
if(location.pathname==='/join'||location.hash==='#join'){studentJoinScreen(new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('code')||'')}else start();
